#~ msgid "Resolved means larger than the significance threshold: {ohm} Ω on a TDR level, {il_db} dB on Sdd21 or S21, {db} dB on Sdd11, S11, Scd21, NEXT and FEXT where the higher of the two levels stands above {floor_db} dB, and {ps} ps on the skew: the design's registered values until gate P4-E measures the model's noise."
